{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:0646257494115c30","name":"Freefall-Class Bomber","source":{"id":"source:reference-0646257494115c30","title":"Freefall-Class Bomber","revision":19907,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:50:28Z","sha256":"f0359c6bbb9b381cc42c6611ca479871572bf497cf78edac499af96177d2159e","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19907","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Freefall-Class%20Bomber&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-0646257494115c30","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Lok Revenants"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Lok_Revenants","referenceId":"reference:f35373d7b93f6a5a"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The ",{"tag":"i","children":["Freefall"]},"-Class Starfighter is a bomber manufactured by the Nubian Design Collective. Named for the unguided bombs it is designed to use, the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Freefall"]}," is an effective craft despite its low-tech approach to ordnance delivery. It is a large ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"},", possessing a wide wingspan with a large sublight engine mounted on each wing tip. Cargo capacity is typically limited to bombs, but the ship can be converted to make supply drops and troop insertions if necessary. \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A ",{"tag":"i","children":["Freefall"]}," requires an extensive crew, including a dedicated pilot, gunner, navigator, and bombardier. Allowing a pilot to focus on maneuvers while providing additional crew to perform other functions is a staple of Nubian design philosophy. In fact, the calibration of these diverse systems is so exacting that as long as a crew of four operates the ship, each gains a +1 bonus to checks and rolls related to his own duties. It is theoretically possible to consolidate systems, thereby reducing the ship's required crew, but this eliminates the aforementioned bonus. \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["During ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Clone Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Clone_Wars"},", the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Freefall"]},"-Class Bomber is employed by several independent mercenary units, mostly on the side of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Republic","referenceId":"reference:332055cafc4223eb"},". The best known of these mercenaries is the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bith","referenceId":"reference:226574d844698c0d"}," engineer ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jinkins"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jinkins?action=edit&redlink=1"},", who flies a heavily modified ",{"tag":"i","children":["Freefall"]},"-Class Bomber with improved weaponry. \n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Normal)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Freefall"]},"-Class Bomber Statistics (CL 8)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Colossal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," -2; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +5\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 15 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 12), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defen